OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy at first, with a few outbreaks
OL,7,Fof mostly light rain easing away.
OL,8,FClearer spells then follow, especially
OL,9,Fafter midnight, although perhaps the
OL,10,Fodd shower still affecting the East
OL,11,FKent coast. Feeling rather chilly by
OL,12,Fdawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FA chilly start, followed by
OL,15,Fa bright and largely sunny day.
OL,16,FHowever the odd shower remains
OL,17,Fpossible for the east Kent coast. Cold
OL,18,Fand breezy overnight, however winds
OL,19,Fgradually easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
