OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFine,
OL,6,Fbut cold Friday with sunny spells.
OL,7,FSome cloud building overnight, however
OL,8,Fsome patchy frost still possible.
OL,9,FLikely rather cloudy Saturday and
OL,10,FSunday, but perhaps turning less cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
